{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792121580, "covers_from": "2026-10-16T03:33:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-16T03:34:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792121640, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-16T03:33:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 54443, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "市長\n大安區摩托車的位置越來越少了\n沒有位置停放好困擾啊", "display_name": "大安代表 Miffy", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T03:33:09+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56416, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "有些公車站因不大，所以等車時無法排隊，會造成明明先到卻晚上車的情形，尤其搭跨縣市客運，有時會讓人不平", "display_name": "大同代表 No.56,416", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T03:33:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31928, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "可不可以讓老人輪椅能在人行道安全的行走，現在的人行道有很多燈桿，電箱，階梯的阻擋，輪椅要跟汽車爭道", "display_name": "中正代表 No.31,928", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-16T03:33:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 21, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43392, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "蔣市長與捷運局應該道歉，並把拆掉的柱子和把手及博愛座，全部裝回捷運。蔣不裝，則由新市長加回去，蔣下台", "display_name": "信義代表 No.43,392", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 56416, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.56,416", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 31928, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.31,928", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 43392, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.43,392", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 65212, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldto